  "description": "Two years ago, Kang I-Do, my childhood friend who fled to Paris like a runaway to succeed in ballet, has returned.\n\n *“Starting to get interested now, huh?”\n“What are you talking about?”\n“Then take your eyes off me. I'm gonna melt.”\n“Who's staring? Are you crazy?”*\n\nHis toned physique visible through a thin T-shirt and tights, his provocative gaze. Amidst banter that teeters between wariness and fluttering feelings, the relationship between I-Do and Seo-Eon grows increasingly intense... Can their friendship truly endure?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
